      <div class="claim-text"> <b>11</b>. The separator as claimed in <claim-ref idref="CLM-00010">claim 10</claim-ref>, wherein the inorganic particles include at least one selected from the group of Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>, SiO<sub>2</sub>, B<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>, Ga<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>, TiO<sub>2 </sub>and SnO<sub>2 </sub>particles.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00012" num="00012" class="claim">
