    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00013" num="00013" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>13</b>. The separator as claimed in <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the separator has a thermal shrinkage of about 30% or less in a machine direction (MD) or in a transverse direction (TD), as measured after the separator is kept at 150° C. for 1 hour.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00014" num="00014" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>14</b>. The separator as claimed in <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the separator has a wettability of about 80 seconds or less.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00015" num="00015" class="claim">
